"Days before Christmas 2040, Grand Senator Servin-ith toured F-city's Christmas market."
"On her second trip to Earth, she called the Submerger flood 'our error'."
"Graham, a Brute who lost his fiancee in the flood, lunged to punch Ambassador Bash-nor."
"Alden blocked the punch with a preserved cotton candy pig balloon; the 'pig save' went viral."
"Votary Drusi-otta levitated Graham away; knights Esh-erdi and Lind-otta arrived after."
"Servin-ith removed Bash-nor as ambassador at once, and gave his goodbye speech herself."
